re the only other example, besides the Elemental Dragons, of a Primordial/Yozi's children.</div> </div> </div> </div>Canonical example. Presumably Canon Ninjas won't come after us if we decide that the Lintha are literally Kimbery's Children or that, say, Szorny has also had some kids.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-30T10:41:30-07:00","id":979150,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/977152-dragon-bloods-are-daemons?p=979145#post979145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Canonical example. Presumably Canon Ninjas won't come after us if we decide that the Lintha are literally Kimbery's Children or that, say, Szorny has also had some kids.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually isn't Lintha Ng Oro (sp?) literally Kimbery's child? Also there's that jungle-slug in Malfeas I thought was a child rather than a behemoth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-30T13:05:16-07:00","id":979222,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blackwell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/977152-dragon-bloods-are-daemons?p=979150#post979150\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Actually isn't Lintha Ng Oro (sp?) literally Kimbery's child? Also there's that jungle-slug in Malfeas I thought was a child rather than a behemoth.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is possible I'm forgetting some other progeny.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-30T19:02:01-07:00","id":979412,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/977152-dragon-bloods-are-daemons?p=979222#post979222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is possible I'm forgetting some other progeny.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or I remembered wrong. Checked CoCD:Malfeas and the Sideways Forest is a behemoth. Couldn't remember where Lintha Ng Oro gets mentioned.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-30T19:21:52-07:00","id":979423,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blackwell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/977152-dragon-bloods-are-daemons?p=979412#post979412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Couldn't remember where Lintha Ng Oro gets mentioned.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Blood and Salt</i>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-01T00:12:43-07:00","id":979537,"title":"","content":"Aren't all demons ultimately descended from the Yozis? And isn't one of the prerequisites for being a Yozi being locked away inside Malfeas' inside-out body, suffering endless torment and forever bound against directly acting to harm the gods or creation? And didn't Gaia avoid that fate by siding with the gods? So then Gaia wouldn't be a Yozi, and thus her descendants wouldn't be demons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11640-djinnkitty83","name":"Djinnkitty83","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-01T05:19:18-07:00","id":979603,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Djinnkitty83</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/977152-dragon-bloods-are-daemons?p=979537#post979537\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aren't all demons ultimately descended from the Yozis? And isn't one of the prerequisites for being a Yozi being locked away inside Malfeas' inside-out body, suffering endless torment and forever bound against directly acting to harm the gods or creation? And didn't Gaia avoid that fate by siding with the gods? So then Gaia wouldn't be a Yozi, and thus her descendants wouldn't be demons.</div> </div> </div> </div>The term that was used once or maybe twice in 2e for souls of non-imprisoned Primordials in place of &quot;demon&quot; was &quot;kami&quot;, though that was late in the line. But that distinction was much more of a semantic one than, say, the lines between demons, gods, and elementals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":456,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","user":"Blackwell","date":". 10-01-2016, 08:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-01T07:52:15-07:00","id":979655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blackwell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/977152-dragon-bloods-are-daemons?p=979603#post979603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The term that was used once or maybe twice in 2e for souls of non-imprisoned Primordials in place of &quot;demon&quot; was &quot;kami&quot;, though that was late in the line. But that distinction was much more of a semantic one than, say, the lines between demons, gods, and elementals.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Kami&quot;, I think, is the term for Gaia's souls. &quot;Devas&quot; is the term for the souls of non-imprisoned Primordials in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-01T08:44:04-07:00","id":979682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/977152-dragon-bloods-are-daemons?p=979423#post979423\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Blood and Salt</i>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>DoFA: Lands of Creation<br /> pg. 102: &quot;The Lintha\u2019s Great Mother was banished to Malfeas, and their cousin and homeland, the living continent Lintha Ng Oroo, was shattered, leaving only small remnants behind.&quot;<br /> <br /> pg. 130: &quot;This body, however, is merely a shell suffused with her immortal spiritual Essence, much like her distant cousin Mother Bog in the East.&quot;<br /> <br /> COUSIN???","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2150-rochedo","name":"Rochedo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2150_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-01T09:36:55-07:00","id":979723,"title":"","content":"The island is cousin of the Lintha, many <i>many</i> times removed. As for the relation to Mother Bog, my understanding is that that was another 2e-ism, some author saying, &quot;Oh, <i>two</i> living terrains? Let's make them related!&quot; And so the setting grew a little smaller.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-01T11:25:49-07:00","id":979763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/977152-dragon-bloods-are-daemons?p=979723#post979723\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The island is cousin of the Lintha, many <i>many</i> times removed. As for the relation to Mother Bog, my understanding is that that was another 2e-ism, some author saying, &quot;Oh, <i>two</i> living terrains? Let's make them related!&quot; And so the setting grew a little smaller.</div> </div> </div> </div>More or less. Beat me to it. <br /> <br /> And stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T17:32:29-07:00","id":981126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/977152-dragon-bloods-are-daemons?p=979145#post979145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Canonical example. Presumably Canon Ninjas won't come after us if we decide that the Lintha are literally Kimbery's Children or that, say, Szorny has also had some kids.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oroo is either Kimbery's creation or her child, I can't tell which. Szoreny and Malfeas also did some very shiny dancing together that produced a pod-child/living manse.<br /> <br /> There's a clear distinction between the souls of Primordials and everything else they create. And there's a clear distinction between unique beings (or very small groups of similar beings, such as the Five Dragons) and members of entire species. But it's less clear to me how to distinguish a Primordial's unique offspring from its unique creation. When it comes to the Titans, physically giving birth can hardly be the only way to produce offspring.<br /> <br /> I imagine Gaia and Kimbery might literally give birth to their offspring. Adorjan produced her daughters by mating with a Solar in his dreams. But Malfeas and Szoreny danced together and there was this huge flash of light and then a pod/tree/manse grew. Is that &quot;reproduction,&quot; or just constructing a behemoth? Is the Unconquered Sun only a creation of Theion and Cytherea, or their child? Does the distinction even have meaning?<br /> <br /> I'm not sure there is a difference, unless the Primordial creator/parent decides there is, or one of the parents is something else like a human.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 10-03-2016, 08:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-03T17:50:44-07:00","id":981137,"title":"","content":"If my girlfriend and I carve pieces of wood into shapes, sand them, assemble them together, and paint the finished product, we've made something.<br /> <br /> If my girlfriend and I have unprotected sex resulting in pregnancy, and the pregnancy gets carried to term, we've <i>also</i> made something.<br /> <br /> Sure, one's a birdhouse, and one's a baby, but categorizing them strictly by how they came into being is pretty arbitrary. There's a million other differences between the two that are at least as significant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 10-03-2016, 08:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-04T13:35:21-07:00","id":981661,"title":"","content":"With beings as bizarre and diverse as Primordials, I don't think there's any objective way to decide what counts as their progeny and what doesn't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}